    "The TrxID is in the %@ message after you pay. It's saved as typed by you and isn't checked with %@. TakaDe never asks for your PIN.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "পেমেন্টের পর %@-এর মেসেজে TrxID থাকে। এটি আপনার লেখা হিসেবেই সেভ হয়, %@-এর সাথে যাচাই করা হয় না। TakaDe কখনো আপনার PIN চায় না।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TrxID is in the %@ message after you pay. It's saved as typed by you and isn't checked with %@. TakaDe never asks for your PIN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi %@, a quick reminder from %@: %@ to me when you get a chance.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
