    "Anyone with this link can join for 7 days. They'll see this group's expenses and payments and can add their own. Names and amounts are encrypted on the phone before they're sent.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "এই লিংক যার কাছে থাকবে, তিনি ৭ দিনের মধ্যে যোগ দিতে পারবেন। তিনি এই গ্রুপের খরচ ও পেমেন্ট দেখবেন এবং নিজেও যোগ করতে পারবেন। পাঠানোর আগে নাম ও টাকার অঙ্ক ফোনেই এনক্রিপ্ট করা হয়।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone with this link can join for 7 days. They'll see this group's expenses and payments and can add their own. Names and amounts are encrypted on the phone before they're sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop this link": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
