    "Until TakaDe's website is ready, WhatsApp and Messenger may not open the link with a tap. Your friend can copy the message, open TakaDe and tap Join with a link.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "TakaDe-এর ওয়েবসাইট চালু না হওয়া পর্যন্ত WhatsApp ও Messenger-এ ট্যাপ করলে লিংকটি না-ও খুলতে পারে। আপনার বন্ধু মেসেজটি কপি করে TakaDe খুলে “লিংক দিয়ে যোগ দিন” চাপতে পারেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Until TakaDe's website is ready, WhatsApp and Messenger may not open the link with a tap. Your friend can copy the message, open TakaDe and tap Join with a link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links to this group no longer work. People who already joined stay in the group.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "এই গ্রুপের লিংকগুলো আর কাজ করবে না। যাঁরা আগেই যোগ দিয়েছেন, তাঁরা গ্রুপে থাকবেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
