    "Join %@ on TakaDe to see and add our shared expenses: %@\n\nIf the link doesn't open, copy this message, open TakaDe and tap Join with a link.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "TakaDe-তে %@ গ্রুপে যোগ দিন, আমাদের ভাগের খরচ দেখতে ও যোগ করতে: %@\n\nলিংক না খুললে এই মেসেজটি কপি করে TakaDe খুলুন এবং “লিংক দিয়ে যোগ দিন” চাপুন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join %@ on TakaDe to see and add our shared expenses: %@\n\nIf the link doesn't open, copy this message, open TakaDe and tap Join with a link."
