        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "এখানে শুধু TakaDe-এর ইনভাইট লিংক কাজ করে। গ্রুপের কাউকে গ্রুপের ইনভাইট বোতামে চাপ দিয়ে আপনাকে লিংকটি পাঠাতে বলুন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only invite links from TakaDe work here. Ask someone in the group to tap the invite button in the group and send you the link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll see this group's expenses and payments and can add your own.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "আপনি এই গ্রুপের খরচ ও পেমেন্ট দেখতে পাবেন এবং নিজেরগুলোও যোগ করতে পারবেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll see this group's expenses and payments and can add your own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many tries for now. Wait a while and try again.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
