    "Messages are encrypted on your phone so only your friend's phone can read them. TakaDe's server sees who writes to whom and when, not what.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
